 "remarks": "Immaculate, spacious, and sun-filled townhouse with an attached garage and beautiful new hardwood floors.  The inviting living room features a cathedral ceiling, a wood-burning fireplace, and sliders leading to a private balcony. The open layout creates a bright and comfortable living space. The main-level primary suite offers multiple closets and a full bathroom with double sinks, a separate shower, and a Jacuzzi tub. Upstairs, the second en-suite bedroom provides additional privacy and comfort, with its own full bathroom.  The finished lower level has two additional rooms, ideal for a home office, exercise room, or extra living space, along with a convenient laundry room.  Enjoy comfortable, low-maintenance living in a desirable community. Walk to shopping, restaurants, and train. A wonderful opportunity for anyone looking for a spacious, well-maintained home in a convenient location! Fabulous commuting location.",
